    "article_summary": "The article describes a scalable and regioselective trifluoromethoxylation of functionalized pyridines and pyrimidines using Togni reagent I. The method proceeds via a radical O-trifluoromethylation of N-heteroaryl-N-hydroxylamine precursors followed by a thermally induced OCF3-migration, providing access to a new class of synthetic building blocks for medicinal and materials science.",
